  SNYK-DEBIAN13-ZLIB-19520500:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          zlib1g, introduced by the base image node:24.18.1-trixie-slim via
          dpkg/apt — a base-OS package, not an application dependency. No
          fix published for Debian 13 (trixie) yet; base-image upgrade
          recommendations (e.g. alpine) are a separate, bigger migration and
          not being done as a point fix. Accepted pending upstream Debian
          patch or a deliberate base-image migration. Recheck on base-image
          bump.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-DEBIAN13-SQLITE3-17334397:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          libsqlite3-0, introduced by the base image
          node:24.18.1-trixie-slim via util-linux/liblastlog2-2 — a base-OS
          package, not an application dependency. Debian has published a
          fix (3.46.1-7+deb13u2), but it isn't present in any currently
          published node:*-trixie-slim tag — confirmed by Snyk's own base
          image comparison showing identical vulnerability counts across
          current tags, so no available tag swap resolves this today.
          Accepted pending a republished image. Recheck on base-image bump.
        expires: '2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z'
  SNYK-DEBIAN13-SQLITE3-17334400:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause and dependency path as
          SNYK-DEBIAN13-SQLITE3-17334397 — base-OS package, Debian has a
          fix (3.46.1-7+deb13u2) not yet present in any published image
